        },
        {
          "text": "Wan jo Icrael, ajwagi, Lulevi, lugwok-doggola me ot pa Lubaŋa, luwer, ki lutic i ot pa Lubaŋa ki jo mukene ducu ma wapokke woko kenwa ki i kom jo ma gibedo i lobo meno, wek walub cik pa Lubaŋa, wan kacel ki monwa ki litinowa awobe ki anyira ducu ‘ma doŋ gin dito ma giromo niaŋ lok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kombeddi waribbe ki utmegiwa, ki luditowa kun wakwoŋo kwoŋ ma walamme kekenwa ni wek can opot i komwa ka ce pe wabilubo cik man, kun pe walubo cik pa Lubaŋa ma yam Moses latic pa Lubaŋa omiyo botwa. Wakwoŋo ni wabibedo kun watiyo gin ma Rwot ma en R wotwa yam ociko, ki dok ni wabigwoko cikke ducu ki gin ma en mito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
