          "text": "Wan waye me miyo dul me adek i cekel acel mwaka ki mwaka me konyo tic i ot pa Lubaŋawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabimiyo jami magi pi woro Lubaŋa; mugati me aketa i nyim Rwot, gityer me moko kwon pi nino ducu, ki gityer me gitum awaŋa me nino ducu, gityer maleŋ pi nino me cabit ducu, nino madito me por dwe, nino madito ma giciko ducu, jami maleŋ-gu ducu, ki gitum me bal pi kwanyo bal pa jo Icrael, ki jami ma mitte pi tic ducu ma gitiyo i ot pa Lubaŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wan lwak, kacel ki ajwagi, ki Lulevi, wabibolo kwir mwaka ki mwaka me moko kaka mene ma myero gukel yen i ot pa Lubaŋa me wano gitum awaŋa ma gityero bot Rwot Lubaŋawa, kit macalo cik mito, kun gilubo dog odi pa kwarogi, i kare ma giciko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
