              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 18.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabitero mo ko kwon me kai manyen mukwoŋo cek wamiyo bot ajwagi, kacel kijami me kony mewa ma wamiyo, ki gityer mukene ducu macalo me koŋo vino, moo nyig yat jeituni ki kit kwa nyig yadi ducu mapatpat, mwaka ki ki mwaka, kun waketo i kicika odi matino me ot pa Lubaŋa, Wabimiyo dul acel me apar me kwa cam mapatpat ma wapuro bot Lulevi ma gin lujog dul acel me apar ki bot lupur ma tye i gaŋiwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
