                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajwagi ma gin likwayo pa Aron gubed kacel ki Lulevi i kare ma noŋo gigamo dul acel me apar. Lulevi myero gutyer dul acel me apar me jami ma gijogo i ot pa Lubaŋa, i kicika me odi matino, ki i odi me kano jami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Icrael kacel ki Lulevi myero gumi kai, koŋo vino, ki moo me nyig jeituni gukel i odi me kano jami, ka ma gigwoko iye jami ma gitiyo kwedgi i kabedo maleŋ, ka ma ajwagi gitye iye i dog tic, lugwok-doggola, ki dul pa luwer. Wan pe wabibwoto ot pa Lubaŋawa ata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.39"
            ]
          }
